stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> PanelOpen: tap Train
    PanelOpen --> Idle: dismiss
    PanelOpen --> Hub: expand (All training)
    Hub --> Idle: close
    PanelOpen --> Recording: Start
    Hub --> Recording: Start
    Recording --> Minimised: minimise (strength; ride BLOCKED by safety gate)
    Minimised --> ResumePanel: tap Train
    ResumePanel --> Recording: Resume
    ResumePanel --> Minimised: dismiss
    Recording --> Paused: Pause
    Paused --> Recording: Resume
    Paused --> CompletionPending: Finish (ride: only after Pause)
    Recording --> CompletionPending: Finish (strength)
    CompletionPending --> Idle: saved or discarded
    CompletionPending --> SaveUncertain: save fails or is unconfirmed (PENDING decision)
    SaveUncertain --> Idle: resolved
    Recording --> Restored: app interrupted (strength only, as read)
    Restored --> Recording: Resume
    note right of Minimised: A second session cannot be started
